eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VtqVuhE9ZSsQ7kNvwHdpiE3&_nc_oc=AdmxR-MHdFBK2D8OWCDe7r4xQFTWwdaEjBXgb9ErRrAXg8xs55SSw1B4sRH2zOL6R28&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfulzvqiW1qu3WvY4hqhi5aYTin9QlNToyx3WIFGrxoNog&oe=699C474D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qm_anQxw8P0Q7kNvwHcV-IN&_nc_oc=AdmHTRoeNKNsyzKvaD_FI3bLrmlx2Sa3DRlyY7yn5BDAwry1gVgebjg70OyJKu-Mo_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfslMDR6-SSpUfdP7OztJXkWXHBdAtRHj5LGa6ArC79BWA&oe=699C39AC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R5PX7QLihSgQ7kNvwFpFFhA&_nc_oc=AdnArRTDNwwRdIdSheg6eLc8piXPgKXkpkXitwuRXM2fNzBnOP_gjvpqCdnPphCld3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsdAWXlYHb1cyk0PwPupT8dxfGVamTJ-xcsvwrY58wN6A&oe=699C5B3D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eGintA3HPmQQ7